{"success": true, "data": {"id": 36, "displayOrder": 37, "titleKo": "2025 무신사카피 넥스트 패션 스콜라십(MNFS) 6기 최종 장학생 발표", "titleEn": "2025 Musinsa Next Fashion Scholarship (MNFS) 6th Class Final Scholarship Winners Announced", "titleJa": "2025無神社ネクストファッションスコラシップ（MNFS）6期最終奨学生発表", "titleZh": "2025年Musinsa Next Fashion奖学金（MNFS）第六届最终获奖者名单公布", "contentKo": "<figure class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded my-4 block [&amp;+*]:mt-4\"><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/notice_36_content_0.png\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded block\" /></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>무신사카피는 차세대 패션 산업을 이끌어갈 실력 있는 인재들을 발굴하고 지원하고 있습니다. 이번 무신사카피 넥스트 패션 스콜라십 6기 선발에 많은 관심과 지원을 보내주신 모든 분들께 진심으로 감사드립니다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>1차 서류 심사와 2차 인터뷰 심사를 거치며, 패션 브랜드 론칭을 향한 여러분의 열정과 도전은 저희에게도 좋은 귀감이 되었습니다. 지원해 주신 분들 가운데 우수한 역량을 가진 분들이 많았지만, 한정된 인원을 선발해야 하기에 아쉬움이 남습니다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>이번에 함께하지 못한 분들과도 앞으로 무신사카피와 좋은 인연으로 다시 뵐 수 있기를 바랍니다. 다시 한번 지원해 주신 모든 분들께 감사의 인사를 전합니다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><table style=\"min-width:75px\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>&zwj;</p></td><th class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2 font-semibold\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>2025 MNFS 6기 최종 장학생 명단</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>구분</p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>이름</p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>휴대폰 뒷자리</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">고*호</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1429</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">2</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">구*령</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">7067</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">3</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">권*윤</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1093</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">4</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">기*진</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1643</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">5</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">김*아</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">3791</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">6</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">김*찬</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">8975</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">7</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">김*은</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">7775</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">8</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">김*찬</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1348</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">9</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">서*민</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1691</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">10</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">우*웅</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">9224</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">11</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">이*용</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">0540</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">12</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">임*빈</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">6828</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">13</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">임*서</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1256</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">14</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">정*용</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">8246</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">15</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">정*연</span></p></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 p-2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">4525</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&zwj;</p><p>상단의 장학생 명단에서 본인 이름과 휴대폰 뒷자리를 확인했으나, 안내 메일을 받지 못하신 경우 MNFS 운영사무국으로 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>※ <strong>문의처</strong>: MNFS 운영 사무국 / mnfs@musinsaptnr.com</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentEn": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:3169px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/68bfdaac6d27ba93470f6ccd_MUSINSACOPY_ESG%ED%8C%80_MNFS6%EA%B8%B0_%EC%B5%9C%EC%A2%85%EC%9E%A5%ED%95%99%EC%83%9D%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C%EC%8D%B8%EB%84%A4%EC%9D%BC.png\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa is discovering and supporting talented individuals who will lead the next generation of the fashion industry. We sincerely thank everyone who showed interest and support for the 6th Musinsa Next Fashion Scholarship.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Through the first round of document screening and the second round of interviews, your passion and dedication to launching a fashion brand served as a valuable example for us. While many of the applicants possessed exceptional talent, we regret that we had to select only a limited number of applicants.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>I hope to see those who couldn't join us this time and have a good relationship with Musinsa again in the future. I would like to once again express my gratitude to everyone who supported us.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n<table class=\"tg\">\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-dcnc\" colspan=\"3\">2025 MNFS 6th Final Scholarship Recipients List</th>\n  </tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">division</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">name</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">Last digits of the phone number</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Go*ho</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1429</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">2</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Gu*ryeong</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7067</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kwon*Yoon</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1093</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">4</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Ki*jin</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1643</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">5</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kim*Ah</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3791</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">6</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kim*Chan</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8975</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kim* is</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7775</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kim*Chan</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1348</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">people</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1691</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">10</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Woo*ung</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9224</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">11</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">utilization</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">0540</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">12</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Lim*bin</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">6828</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">13</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Lim*seo</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1256</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">14</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Jeong*yong</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8246</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">15</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Jeong*yeon</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">4525</span></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>If you have checked your name and the last 4 digits of your phone number on the list of scholarship recipients above but have not received a notification email, please contact the MNFS Operations Office.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>※<strong>Contact</strong>: MNFS Operations Office / mnfs@musinsaptnr.com</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentJa": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:3169px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/68bfdaac6d27ba93470f6ccd_MUSINSACOPY_ESG%ED%8C%80_MNFS6%EA%B8%B0_%EC%B5%9C%EC%A2%85%EC%9E%A5%ED%95%99%EC%83%9D%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C%EC%8D%B8%EB%84%A4%EC%9D%BC.png\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>武神社は次世代ファッション産業をリードする実力ある人材を発掘して支援しています。今回の無神社ネクストファッションスコラシップ6期選抜に多くの関心と支援を送ってくださった皆さんに心から感謝します。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>1次書類審査と2次インタビュー審査を経て、ファッションブランドのローンチに向けた皆さんの情熱と挑戦は私たちにも良い貴感になりました。支援してくださった方々の中で優秀な能力を持った方が多かったのですが、限られた人数を選抜しなければならないのに残念が残ります。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>今回一緒にできなかった方とも、今後無神社と良い縁でまたお会いできることを願っています。もう一度応援してくださった皆さんに感謝の挨拶をお伝えします。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n<table class=\"tg\">\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-dcnc\" colspan=\"3\">2025 MNFS 6期最終奨学生リスト</th>\n  </tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">区分</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">名前</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">携帯電話の後部座席</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">高*号</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1429</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">2</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">旧*霊</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7067</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">クォン*ユン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1093</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">4</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">キ・ジン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1643</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">5</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">キム*ああ</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3791</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">6</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">キム・チャン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8975</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">キム*ウン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7775</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">キム・チャン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1348</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">ソ・ミン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1691</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">10</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">ウ*ウン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9224</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">11</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">使用*</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">0540</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">12</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">イム*ビン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">6828</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">13</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">イム*</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1256</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">14</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">チョン*ヨン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8246</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">15</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">チョン*ヨン</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">4525</span></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>上段の奨学生名簿で本人の名前と携帯電話の後席を確認しましたが、案内メールが届かない場合は、MNFS運営事務局にお問い合わせください。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>※ <strong>お問い合わせ</strong>: MNFS運営事務局 / mnfs@musinsaptnr.com</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p>", "contentZh": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:3169px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/68bfdaac6d27ba93470f6ccd_MUSINSACOPY_ESG%ED%8C%80_MNFS6%EA%B8%B0_%EC%B5%9C%EC%A2%85%EC%9E%A5%ED%95%99%EC%83%9D%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C%EC%8D%B8%EB%84%A4%EC%9D%BC.png\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa致力于发掘和支持引领时尚产业下一代的杰出人才。我们衷心感谢所有对第六届Musinsa Next Fashion奖学金表现出关注和支持的朋友们。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>在第一轮文件筛选和第二轮面试中，您对创立时尚品牌的热情和投入给我们留下了深刻的印象。虽然很多申请者都才华横溢，但遗憾的是，我们最终只能录取有限数量的申请者。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>我希望这次未能到场的朋友们能够再次相聚，也希望未来能与穆辛萨保持良好的关系。我再次衷心感谢所有支持我们的人。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n<table class=\"tg\">\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-dcnc\" colspan=\"3\">2025年MNFS第六届最终奖学金获得者名单</th>\n  </tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">分配</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">姓名</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-dcnc\">电话号码的最后几位数字</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Go*ho</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1429</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">2</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">九灵</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7067</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">权允</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1093</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">4</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">基*金</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1643</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">5</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">金雅</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">3791</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">6</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">金灿</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8975</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Kim*是</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">7775</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">8</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">金灿</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1348</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">人们</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">1691</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">10</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">宇*ung</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">9224</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">11</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">利用率</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">0540</span></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-o8np\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">12</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">林宾</span></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-byna\"><span style=\"font-we